flowchart LR
    Jobs[Player chooses school priority in Workers / Jobs] --> Owner[Rear request owns target and priority]
    Count[Player changes Instructor target] --> Duty[Resolve current active school]
    Duty --> Read[Read that request's current priority]
    Read --> Submit[Submit new count with existing priority]
    Submit --> Owner
    Owner --> Physical[Existing allocation, safe carry completion and reporting]
    Physical --> UI[Existing committed-event UI refresh]
